            "notes": "The deck focuses on quickly deploying creatures and equipment to put pressure on the opponent. It utilizes low to the ground aggressive creatures like Spectacular Spider-Man and Helitrooper alongside powerful equipment like Umezawa's Jitte and Sword of Fire and Ice to create efficient threats. The deck also includes disruption elements like Thalia, Guardian of Thraben and Drannith Magistrate to disrupt the opponent's game plan. With cards like Stoneforge Mystic and Recruiter of the Guard, the deck can consistently find its key pieces. The goal is to establish a board presence quickly and overwhelm the opponent before they can stabilize, ultimately securing victory through consistent aggression and disruption."
